    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple upgradable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced twin-stick shooting and melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create outlandish weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades, abilities, skill trees, and MORE! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazed AI robot Gods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RAGNAROK ROGUELITE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try, die and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up, amass firepower &amp; hone your skills to fight your way through the post-apocalyptic Viking future and take down Odin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade characters with unique skill trees and unlock new skins &amp; customisations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punch gods in the face with your robot arm as the Cyberserker. Slice your way through mobs with the Dark Elf. Stampede your foes as a Viking Moose. Mine gold to upgrade your gear as the Dwarf, or dual wield miniguns twice your size as the manic Gnome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN FIREPOWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a minigun that shoots homing bullets covered in acid that heals you?... You got that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a crossbow that shoots 7 arrows at once, bounces around corners and freezes enemies?... You can do that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a giant fork to\u2026 fork things?\u2026 Ok, I guess\u2026 You do you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIANT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Odin isn't your only problem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down huge wolves, ice giants, ancient Vikings and possessed greatswords!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE THE HORDES</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the endless Viking hordes in the arena to test your skills and unlock the best weapons\u2026 can you make it out alive? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/79193ad537f7680464f8f6071589b95b.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple upgradable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced twin-stick shooting and melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create outlandish weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades, abilities, skill trees, and MORE! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crazed AI robot Gods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RAGNAROK ROGUELITE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c4d51035de6f7d12aaaa36037670dca6.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try, die and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up, amass firepower &amp; hone your skills to fight your way through the post-apocalyptic Viking future and take down Odin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/2e88f9f61c0e44dd649e07f307a42c51.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade characters with unique skill trees and unlock new skins &amp; customisations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punch gods in the face with your robot arm as the Cyberserker. Slice your way through mobs with the Dark Elf. Stampede your foes as a Viking Moose. Mine gold to upgrade your gear as the Dwarf, or dual wield miniguns twice your size as the manic Gnome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN FIREPOWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/bdc018acf7565f062e0496849274b59c.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a minigun that shoots homing bullets covered in acid that heals you?... You got that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a crossbow that shoots 7 arrows at once, bounces around corners and freezes enemies?... You can do that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a giant fork to\u2026 fork things?\u2026 Ok, I guess\u2026 You do you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIANT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/11e378decd2a1233a4f5bfb2b99878c3.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Odin isn't your only problem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down huge wolves, ice giants, ancient Vikings and possessed greatswords!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE THE HORDES</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.poster.avif?t=1749209287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.webm?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154240/extras/c01af44c75b8fe5ccd02cc7c91db99bf.mp4?t=1749209287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the endless Viking hordes in the arena to test your skills and unlock the best weapons\u2026 can you make it out alive? </p>",
